    "description": "Search and AI-answer visibility (SEO, AEO, GEO). Use when the marketer asks \"am I in the answer when people ask ChatGPT or Google for products like mine?\", \"improve my SEO\", \"why does ChatGPT recommend my competitor\", \"are we in AI Overviews\", \"organic traffic is flat\", \"ChatGPT says something wrong about us\", \"fix my app store listing\" or \"my Google Business Profile and local search\". Shows, question by question, where the brand is named and who wins instead, with a search roadmap and five fixes to apply this week. Never edits anything live. Not for writing the full page — use make-content; not Amazon or marketplace listings (not covered yet); not paid search — use run-paid-campaigns.",
